5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like to live next to the bins! Let's find out how other neighborhoods handle it so we don't make a smelly mistake.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree that learning from others is a great idea. I'm also worried about the costs; we should check the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy to see what we can afford.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not forget the human element. I'll check the ward complaint log for this point and the statements at the residents' meeting. It's better to know exactly why everyone is so annoyed before we start.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm with you all, but let's be practical about the workload. I'll check the supervised mornings on the next lane and the station block's meeting minutes to see how much time this actually takes.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need objective data to ensure fairness. I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk to see what is legally and spatially permissible.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going to check the visit to the station block's bin house and the supervised mornings on the next lane! I want to see if they actually look and smell okay.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That sounds like a good plan, Rin. I'll stick with my choice to look into the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs to get a clear picture of our budget.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll stick with the complaint log and the residents' meeting statements. If we ignore the history of the friction here, we're just rearranging the deck chairs on a sinking ship. Let's get the real story.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'll stick with the supervised mornings on the next lane and the station block's meeting minutes. I want to see the actual hours spent on maintenance so we don't accidentally volunteer ourselves into exhaustion.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will proceed with the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements. We cannot discuss a fair distribution of the burden without knowing the exact physical constraints and official regulations.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm all set! I can't wait to see if the other places are cleaner. I hope we find a way to make our corner a happy place to walk past again!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm all set too. I really hope we can find a solution that is fair for everyone's wallet. I'll report back on the finances as soon as I have the details.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm ready. While you all chase numbers and smells, I'll be digging into the grievances. It's far more interesting to see who's actually complaining and why. Let's see what the records reveal.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm all set as well. Let's just make sure we don't overlook the ""invisible"" work. I'll be looking for the real time-cost of these arrangements so we can keep this sustainable and stress-free.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I am also ready. Once we have the measurements and the legal requirements, we can determine if the current placement is equitable or if a rotation is physically possible. I look forward to the data.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm super excited! I'll go on my little adventure to see the other bins now. See you all soon with all the juicy details about how they look and smell!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll head out to gather the financial information now. I hope we can find a balance that doesn't put too much pressure on any one household. See you all soon!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be off to uncover the drama. Let's hope the records are honest, though people usually are when they're complaining. I'll see you all shortly with the ""human"" side of the data.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm off to do some digging! I'll find out exactly how many hours of our lives this takes so we don't end up as unpaid servants to the trash. See you all in a bit!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will begin my research. It is essential that we base our final decision on factual measurements and official guidelines rather than assumptions. I will report my findings in the next round.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
